From 77fefc7fe0e7e24f409bc13456362079313dcd61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emerald Tablet <emeraldtablet@local>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 20:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: refine Pencil, mods, and onboarding

Purpose: Tune physical iPad navigation and text input, make Pencil secondary actions useful across menus, replace the unavailable network mod listing with a Files-based .sgx import, and remove developer-facing UI noise.

Affected platforms: iOS and iPadOS behavior only, apart from inert shared declarations and a corrected localization lookup.

Upstream status: Candidate after physical acceptance; native Pencil, Files, keyboard fallback, and presentation defaults remain Emerald Tablet specific.

Tests: Simulator build, clean patch reconstruction, repository safety scan, app audit, device build, preservation-safe physical iPad install and launch.
---

